{
  "file": "module2",
  "page": 37,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.5558471679688,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "In contrast, additional resources are needed to undertake chest radiography and mWRDs. Radiography",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.2485961914062,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "involves exposure to some ionizing radiation, which may increase the long-term risks of cancer.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.2362670898438,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "Innovations in radiography in recent years have substantially reduced radiation exposure levels.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4498291015625,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "CXR is largely considered safe, with a radiation dose of 0.1 mSv, which corresponds to 1/30 of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.41357421875,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "average annual radiation dose from the environment (3 mSv) and 1/10 of the annual accepted dose",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.4287719726562,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "of ionizing radiation for the general public (1 mSv). Pregnant women are especially vulnerable to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.4133911132812,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "ionizing radiation from radiography, and children have a longer life expectancy and, therefore, more",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        527.3967895507812,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "time to develop radiation-induced health effects. However, for a pregnant woman and her fetus and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.99073791503906,
        527.456298828125,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "for children, CXR has been deemed to not pose a significant risk, provided that good practices are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        183.39674377441406,
        386.43218994140625,
        200.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "(68) observed, as the primary beam is targeted away from the pelvis  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        205.10060119628906,
        527.4064331054688,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "(69) When used for screening, mWRDs have different accuracy than when they are used for diagnosis  ,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.972265243530273,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.473876953125,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "and different predictive values are associated with a positive test and a negative test due to differences",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966548919677734,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.233154296875,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "in prevalence of TB in the populations being tested. Therefore, results should be interpreted",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.5849609375,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "appropriately, and those who screen positive for TB using an mWRD should receive a thorough",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.6947021484375,
        527.4080810546875,
        275.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "clinical evaluation that may include further tests and procedures – such as CXR, repeat mWRD on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        527.3947143554688,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "additional sputum samples and other examinations – to establish a diagnosis of TB definitively prior",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        527.3110961914062,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "to initiating treatment. These tests can be used on sputum only when a person can expectorate.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.294677734375,
        527.3903198242188,
        314.7377014160156
      ],
      "text": "Scaling up mWRDs for diagnosis should be prioritized (if full access has not yet been achieved) prior",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        313.49468994140625,
        527.1911010742188,
        327.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "to scaling up mWRDs for screening. Using an mWRD as a screening tool requires significant resources,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969457626342773,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        326.6947021484375,
        527.6192016601562,
        341.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "including increased capacity in and expansion of diagnostic and sample transportation networks.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.89471435546875,
        527.4878540039062,
        354.3377380371094
      ],
      "text": "Depending on the feasibility and resources available, countries may choose to prioritize TB screening",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992847442626953,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.0946960449219,
        391.1334533691406,
        367.5377197265625
      ],
      "text": "using mWRDs among certain subpopulations with a higher risk of TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.7986145019531,
        527.4048461914062,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "Countries should position symptom screening, CXR and mWRDs within national TB screening and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.99859619140625,
        527.3970336914062,
        402.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic algorithms, according to the goals and objectives of the screening, the populations being",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.1986083984375,
        527.4388427734375,
        415.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "screened, the feasibility, resources available, and equity. A range of possible screening algorithms",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.39862060546875,
        516.7109375,
        428.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "is presented in the operational handbook, including modelled performance of the expected yield.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        442.8299255371094,
        500.6555480957031,
        467.62493896484375
      ],
      "text": "3.2 Use of computer-aided detection software for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.62982177734375,
        475.6706848144531,
        490.4248352050781
      ],
      "text": "automated reading of digital chest radiographs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        504.396728515625,
        479.9702453613281,
        518.8397216796875
      ],
      "text": "10. Among individuals aged 15 years and older in populations in which TB screening is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        516.396728515625,
        491.8995666503906,
        530.8397216796875
      ],
      "text": "recommended, computer-aided detection software programmes may be used in place of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        528.396728515625,
        494.10076904296875,
        542.8397216796875
      ],
      "text": "human readers for interpreting digital chest X-rays for screening and triage for TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        541.8546142578125,
        439.0350646972656,
        559.03662109375
      ],
      "text": "(new recommendation: conditional recommendation, low certainty of evidence).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        586.56640625,
        353.1788635253906,
        604.8363647460938
      ],
      "text": "3.2.1 Summary of the evidence and rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        611.5424194335938,
        527.4540405273438,
        625.9854125976562
      ],
      "text": "The use of CXR to screen for TB is a practice that goes back several decades. CXRs are also routinely",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        624.742431640625,
        527.4365844726562,
        639.1854248046875
      ],
      "text": "used for triage of patients presenting to care who are displaying signs, symptoms or risk factors for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        637.9423828125,
        527.5828857421875,
        652.3853759765625
      ],
      "text": "TB to determine the most appropriate clinical pathway for proper evaluation. However, in many",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        651.142333984375,
        527.3827514648438,
        665.5853271484375
      ],
      "text": "settings, the use of CXR for TB screening and triage for TB disease is limited by the unavailability of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        664.34228515625,
        527.419921875,
        678.7852783203125
      ],
      "text": "trained health personnel to interpret radiography images and by substantial intra- and inter-reader",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        674.7484130859375,
        414.9472961425781,
        691.9854125976562
      ],
      "text": "(70–72) variability in its accuracy to detect abnormalities associated with TB  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        699.246337890625,
        527.390380859375,
        713.6893310546875
      ],
      "text": "Numerous specific software packages that provide CAD, or automated interpretation of digital CXR",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        712.4462890625,
        527.4232177734375,
        726.8892822265625
      ],
      "text": "images for the express purpose of determining the likelihood of TB disease, have been developed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        725.6463012695312,
        527.4376831054688,
        740.0892944335938
      ],
      "text": "and offer a potential technological answer to the numerous implementation challenges inherent in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        738.8463134765625,
        211.80581665039062,
        753.289306640625
      ],
      "text": "human interpretation of CXRs.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        293.323486328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "3. Recommendations for tools for systematic screening for TB disease 25",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}